intent: Track B P0 (audit 2026-09-13): B5 success is four independent observations (exit 0, clean tree, HEAD advanced, the branch's own change present) plus cumulative symbol inventory and go vet after the last merge; B6 hits are returned entity records (never the echoed heading), with a nonexistent-symbol negative control, a bounded-grep baseline and a search-to-materialize flow whose second step is derived from the search output; provenance records an immutable run id, the binary's sha256, the build's source sha and dirtiness, the harness revision, daemon mode and env overrides, and scored outputs read stdout alone; make validate-scorers gates trackB with injected refusal/no-op/partial/heading-only failures. Results regenerated on a clean nool 7.4.0 build (8afc0921): B5 nool 15/15 successful merges in every scenario with complete inventories and passing vet vs git 1/15 in the contended ones; B6 symbol and file queries hit real records, the negative control is unresolved and exits 1; B8 28/28 and B9 30/30 exact
